ry":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Pamlico County runs from 1951 to 2025, and September to October came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those 75 years. In 2026 so far, the middle of the grids got 57% of normal in January to February 2026 and 56% in March to April 2026. Every grid had its driest year in 2001, and grid 17914 got just 65% of normal in 2001.</p>"}
